<title>SWEDEN: SWIMMING-WORLD SHORT-COURSE CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SWIMMING-WORLD SHORT-COURSE CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GOTHENBURG, Sweden 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
